      344   DEFINE FRAME D-Dialog
      345        b-exit AT ROW 1.21 COL 2
      346        b-help AT ROW 1.21 COL 12
      347        b-goods AT ROW 1.21 COL 22
      348        b-parts AT ROW 1.21 COL 32
      349        b-place AT ROW 1.21 COL 42
      350        varbar-code AT ROW 3.67 COL 14.88 COLON-ALIGNED
      351        varentity AT ROW 3.67 COL 67.63 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      352        vartype-bc AT ROW 4.88 COL 14.88 COLON-ALIGNED
